research/audit/wave11-real-analysis.proof-contracts.json-4129-          "claim": "**Claim 4.** If $u < v$ then $u, v \\in [a,b]$ and claim 3 applies verbatim on $[u,v]$; if $u = v$ both sides are $0$ by [L10]; and if $u > v$ then applying the case $u < v$ to the pair $(v,u)$ and multiplying by $-1$ gives the identity, by [L10]. [step 6.1, L10] ∎",
