research/audit/wave11-dispatch/audit-beta-a4.log-7899-{"id":"thm-monotonicity-of-the-integral","statement":"literature-derived","proof":"ai-generated","evidence":"exact-source","urls":["https://www.math.cmu.edu/~gautam/c/2026-269/notes/rint.html","https://encyclopediaofmath.org/wiki/Integral_calculus"],"rationale":"The sources state that pointwise f<=g for two Riemann-integrable functions implies the same order between their integrals. The item extends it to oriented notation by a direct local case split.","alpha_concurred":false,"at":"2026-08-09"}
